<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:10:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</link><description>欧元兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大年度跌幅，欧洲官员呼吁中国让人民币进一步升值，以抑制进口激增。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year'&gt;欧元今年兑人民币汇率将出现二十年来最大跌幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Euro Set for Biggest Annual Drop Against Yuan in Two Decades&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/euro-set-for-biggest-drop-in-two-decades-against-yuan-this-year</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>迪拜股市消除战时损失，成为海湾地区表现最佳的股票</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dubai-stocks-erase-wartime-losses-to-become-a-top-gulf-performer</link><description>在政府支持和弹性经济活动的推动下，迪拜股市已经抹去了自伊朗战争开始以来的所有损失，从海湾地区最大的落后股市转变为表现最好的股市之一。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dubai-stocks-erase-wartime-losses-to-become-a-top-gulf-performer'&gt;迪拜股市消除战时损失，成为海湾地区表现最佳的股票&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Dubai Stocks Erase Wartime Losses to Become a Top Gulf Performer&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/dubai-stocks-erase-wartime-losses-to-become-a-top-gulf-performer</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>奇怪的事情：韦伯对负担能力议程的愿景（播客）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/audio/2026-11-27/odd-lots-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda-podcast</link><description>目前政治上最重要的词是负担能力。这是民主党在中期选举中获胜的一个议题，也是欧洲各地人们走上街头抗议的原因之一：食品、住房和能源日益昂贵。在大流行最严重的时期，我们与伊莎贝拉·韦伯讨论了很多关于通货膨胀的问题，她关于政府可以采取哪些措施来让人们的生活变得更加负担得起的问题已经演变成了一本名为《反法西斯经济学：捍卫负担能力》的书&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/audio/2026-11-27/odd-lots-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda-podcast'&gt;奇怪的事情：韦伯对负担能力议程的愿景（播客）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Odd Lots: Weber’s Vision for an Affordability Agenda (Podcast)&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/audio/2026-11-27/odd-lots-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda-podcast</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>伊莎贝拉·韦伯的负担能力议程愿景</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/isabella-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda</link><description>与《反法西斯经济学》作者的对话。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/isabella-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda'&gt;伊莎贝拉·韦伯的负担能力议程愿景&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Isabella Weber's Vision for an Affordability Agenda&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/isabella-weber-s-vision-for-an-affordability-agenda</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 09:00:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid 